  "description": "Charming Two-Storey Townhouse in a Convenient Town Centre Location\nNestled within the attractive and well-maintained Bridgecourt development, this delightful two-storey townhouse offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly convenient location.\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises a bright and spacious living room that flows seamlessly into an open-plan kitchen, creating an inviting space for both everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, each benefiting from built-in wardrobes, together with a well-appointed shower room.\nSet within a small residential development, this property enjoys a peaceful setting while being just a short stroll from Ballinasloe town centre. A wide range of amenities are within easy walking distance, including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, churches, sporting facilities, and public transport links, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented home in a sought-after location, combining convenience, comfort, and excellent value.",
